  "decision": "Retain the complete Handy printed339 poster broad S as unencoded ss04, preserving narrow default. Threshold 110 retains whole broad shape, open apertures and smoother bowls than other thresholds. Standard printed189 MUSCLES has narrow first S and broad final S in one setting; broad repeat is rougher and slightly narrower from impression variation.",
